OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems the most influential
OL,4,Aparty at Holyrood, Cole-Hamilton says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Liberal Democrats are the
OL,7,Fmost influential group at Holyrood,
OL,8,Fleader Alex Cole-Hamilton has claimed.
OL,10,FAddressing the UK Lib Dem conference in
OL,11,FBrighton, the MSP also described his
OL,12,Fparty as the "antidote" to Reform.
OL,14,FHe hailed its party's "massive leap
OL,15,Fforward" in this year's Holyrood
OL,16,Felection, returning their largest group
OL,17,Fin 20 years.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
